flowchart TB
    Q[Query text + 384-d embedding] --> D[FAISS IndexFlatIP<br/>124,987 vectors, top-200]
    Q --> T[TF-IDF matrix<br/>word 1-2 grams, top-200]
    D --> U[Candidate union up to 400 ids]
    T --> U
    U --> M[Informative-answer mask<br/>removes call-log notes]
    M --> F[Fused score<br/>alpha * dense + (1-alpha) * tfidf<br/>alpha = 0.40]
    F --> R[Topic-aware re-ranking<br/>same-topic candidates first]
    R --> K[Top-3 candidates<br/>dense similarity kept for the gate]
    AM[Advisor memory<br/>human answers since deployment] -.-> U
